== {{int:filedesc}} ==
A "wikipede" (think Wikipedian + centipede), a mascot of sorts for Wikipedia (''see [[:en:Wikipedia:Mascot]]'')

*from [[:en:Image:Wikipedesketch1.png|en:wiki]]
*self made by [[:en:User:Stevertigo|Stevertigo]]
*the drink in his hand is a [[:en:Mate (beverage)|mate]], a South American tea <!--loosely defined-->with a particular culture of sharing. The position of the [[:en:Bombilla#Insertion of the bomba / bombilla|bombilla]] indicates he is offering it to the next person.

